Compiling with mingw requires that you *not* have cygwin in your path,
because the makefile.gcc which is set up by install.bat relies on
command.com or cmd.exe being the shell, not sh.exe.

It also requires mingw32-make, which is IIRC a separate download from
the regular mingw 3.1 download.



